        "list": [
            {
                "content": "```\nInput: matrix = [[1,5,9],[10,11,13],[12,13,15]], k = 8\nOutput: 13\nExplanation: The elements in the matrix are [1,5,9,10,11,12,13,13,15], and the 8th smallest number is 13\n```"
